# Fleet Commander — production MQTT ACL (P0 UC-24).
# With `use_identity_as_username true`, %u below is the TLS client-cert CN.
#
#   fleet-backend  → full control of iot/fleet/# (command publisher)
#   sim-001 …      → may publish only to its own heartbeat/status/register,
#                    and subscribe only its own command topics.

user fleet-backend
topic readwrite iot/fleet/#

# Every certified device: locked to topics carrying ITS OWN id (%u = CN).
pattern write iot/fleet/%u/register
pattern write iot/fleet/%u/heartbeat
pattern write iot/fleet/%u/status/#
pattern read  iot/fleet/%u/command/#
